{"updated":"2026-09-25T18:01:24.797Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: US top court allows Trump to use controversial voter verification system. Elsewhere, lebanese in Brazil, Brazilian in Lebanon. And 🔴 Live: Yemen's president calls on his people to mobilise against Iran-backed Houthis. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on US, at active conflict levels, though Iran, and Ukraine are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, took it in stride — the S&P 500 up 0.8 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial down 3.4 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite up 3.6 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 32 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 5.3 near Vanuatu region. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.1,0.15,0.2,0.22,0.26,0.3,0.35,0.37,0.42,0.46,0.49,0.51,0.55,0.57,0.6,0.73,0.82,0.95,1.28,1.39,1.44,1.47,1.5,1.54,1.57,1.59,1.61,1.66,1.71,1.78,1.83,1.88,1.92,1.95,2,2.03,2.06,2.11,2.16,2.19,2.23,2.28,2.32,2.37,2.43,2.47,2.53,2.6,2.67,2.79,2.9,3.05,3.08,3.12,3.16,3.2,3.25,3.31,3.4,3.48,3.54,3.61,3.66,3.7,3.75,3.8,3.84,3.87,3.89,3.94,3.96,3.98,4,4.05,4.1,4.18,4.24,4.31,4.39,4.45,4.56,4.6,4.66,4.68,4.74,4.85,5,5.13,5.64,5.85,6,6.07,6.12,6.25,6.3,6.38,6.42,6.54,6.56,6.63,6.72,6.9,7.02,7.07,7.13,7.19,7.25,7.3,7.36,7.41,7.46,7.5,7.56,7.62,7.66,7.69,7.72,7.8,7.92,7.98,8.02,8.07,8.1,8.16,8.23,8.28,8.32,8.38,8.43,8.49,8.54,8.6,8.64,8.7,8.74,8.82,8.88,9,9.07,9.11,9.14,9.18,9.22,9.28,9.33,9.39,9.45,9.52,9.59,9.68,9.75,9.8,9.85,9.88,9.95,10.01,10.1,10.16,10.22,10.27,10.37,10.48,10.87,10.98,11.04,11.1,11.14,11.18,11.23,11.26,11.31,11.4,11.44,11.52,11.57,11.66,11.7,11.77,11.82,11.94,11.98,12.02,12.05,12.09,12.12,12.18,12.22,12.27,12.33,12.39,12.52,12.64,12.77,12.82,12.89,12.93,12.98,13.04,13.11,13.16,13.22,13.28,13.32,13.37,13.41,13.44,13.51,13.55,13.63,13.68,13.72,13.78,13.84,13.93,14.05